{"task_id": "Mbpp/2", "solution": "from typing import Iterable, Set, Any\ndef similar_elements(list1: Iterable[Any], list2: Iterable[Any]) -> Set[Any]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds and returns a set of elements common to both input iterables.\n    Raises TypeError if inputs are not iterable or contain unhashable elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n        set1 = set(list1)\n        set2 = set(list2)\n    except TypeError as exc:\n        raise TypeError(\"Both inputs must be iterable of hashable elements\") from exc\n\n    return set1 & set2"}
