{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(input: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts substrings where the sum of digits equals the substring's length.\n    Iterates through all possible substrings, calculating their digit sum and length.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(input)\n    count = 0\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        digit_sum = 0\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            digit_sum += int(input[j])\n            length = j - i + 1\n            if digit_sum == length:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
