{"task_id": "Mbpp/74", "solution": "def is_samepatterns(array1, array2):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if two arrays follow the same pattern of element occurrences.\n    This implementation ensures a one-to-one mapping between distinct values.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(array1) != len(array2):\n        return False\n\n    mapping1 = {}\n    mapping2 = {}\n\n    for i in range(len(array1)):\n        val1 = array1[i]\n        val2 = array2[i]\n\n        if val1 not in mapping1:\n            mapping1[val1] = val2\n        elif mapping1[val1] != val2:\n            return False\n\n        if val2 not in mapping2:\n            mapping2[val2] = val1\n        elif mapping2[val2] != val1:\n            return False\n\n    return True"}
