{"task_id": "Mbpp/113", "solution": "def check_integer(text: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a string represents an integer.\"\"\"\n    import re\n\n    class IntegerChecker:\n        \"\"\"Encapsulates the logic for validating integer strings.\"\"\"\n        _integer_pattern = re.compile(r\"^[+-]?\\d+$\")\n\n        def check_integer(self, s: str) -> bool:\n            \"\"\"Returns True if the string is an integer, False otherwise.\"\"\"\n            return bool(self._integer_pattern.fullmatch(s))\n\n    checker = IntegerChecker()\n    return checker.check_integer(text)"}
