{"task_id": "Mbpp/126", "solution": "def sum_common_divisors(a, b):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of common divisors of two positive integers.\n    \"\"\"\n    divisors_a = set()\n    for i in range(1, int(a**0.5) + 1):\n        if a % i == 0:\n            divisors_a.add(i)\n            divisors_a.add(a // i)\n\n    divisors_b = set()\n    for i in range(1, int(b**0.5) + 1):\n        if b % i == 0:\n            divisors_b.add(i)\n            divisors_b.add(b // i)\n\n    common_divisors = divisors_a.intersection(divisors_b)\n    return sum(common_divisors)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/129", "solution": "def magic_square_test(matrix):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a given matrix is a magic square.\n    A magic square is a square matrix where the sum of each row, each column, and both main diagonals is the same, and all elements are distinct.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(matrix)\n\n    # FR2: Verify Square and basic non-empty check\n    if n == 0 or any(len(row) != n for row in matrix):\n        return False\n\n    # FR3: Verify Distinct Numbers\n    all_elements = []\n    for row in matrix:\n        all_elements.extend(row)\n    if len(set(all_elements)) != n * n:\n        return False\n\n    # Calculate the magic sum from the first row\n    magic_sum = sum(matrix[0])\n\n    # FR4: Verify Equal Sums - Rows\n    for r in range(n):\n        if sum(matrix[r]) != magic_sum:\n            return False\n\n    # FR4: Verify Equal Sums - Columns\n    for c in range(n):\n        col_sum = 0\n        for r in range(n):\n            col_sum += matrix[r][c]\n        if col_sum != magic_sum:\n            return False\n\n    # FR4: Verify Equal Sums - Main Diagonal (top-left to bottom-right)\n    main_diag_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        main_diag_sum += matrix[i][i]\n    if main_diag_sum != magic_sum:\n        return False\n\n    # FR4: Verify Equal Sums - Anti-Diagonal (top-right to bottom-left)\n    anti_diag_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        anti_diag_sum += matrix[i][n - 1 - i]\n    if anti_diag_sum != magic_sum:\n        return False\n\n    return True"}
