{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(array):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the ratio of zeroes to non-zeroes in an array of integers.\n    Returns 0.0 if there are no non-zero elements to avoid division by zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    num_zeros = 0\n    num_non_zeros = 0\n\n    for x in array:\n        if x == 0:\n            num_zeros += 1\n        else:\n            num_non_zeros += 1\n\n    if num_non_zeros == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    else:\n        return float(num_zeros) / num_non_zeros"}
