{"task_id": "Mbpp/392", "solution": "_memo = {}\ndef get_max_sum(n):\n    # Retrieve the result from cache if already computed.\n    if n in _memo:\n        return _memo[n]\n\n    # Base case for the recursion.\n    if n == 0:\n        _memo[n] = 0\n        return 0\n\n    # Recursively calculate the sum of parts using integer division.\n    sum_of_parts = get_max_sum(n // 2) + \\\n                   get_max_sum(n // 3) + \\\n                   get_max_sum(n // 4) + \\\n                   get_max_sum(n // 5)\n\n    # Determine the maximum sum according to the given equation.\n    result = max(sum_of_parts, n)\n\n    # Store the computed result in the cache for future use.\n    _memo[n] = result\n    return result"}
