{"task_id": "Mbpp/414", "solution": "def overlapping(seq1: Iterable, seq2: Iterable) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if any value in seq1 exists in seq2.\n    It optimizes by converting the smaller sequence to a set for efficient lookups.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(seq1) <= len(seq2):\n        smaller_seq = seq1\n        larger_seq = seq2\n    else:\n        smaller_seq = seq2\n        larger_seq = seq1\n\n    smaller_set = set(smaller_seq)\n\n    for item in larger_seq:\n        if item in smaller_set:\n            return True\n\n    return False"}
