{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    Raises ValueError if n is not a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be a positive integer.\")\n    \n    # Using the closed-form formula for the sum of cubes: (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2\n    sum_of_cubes = (n * (n + 1) / 2)**2\n    \n    # The average is the sum of cubes divided by n\n    average = sum_of_cubes / n\n    \n    return float(average)"}
