{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "def cal_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of Perrin numbers up to index n.\"\"\"\n    # Base Perrin numbers: P(0)=3, P(1)=0, P(2)=2\n\n    if n == 0:\n        return 3\n    if n == 1:\n        return 3\n    if n == 2:\n        return 5\n\n    # Initialize previous Perrin numbers and the cumulative sum\n    p_prev_3 = 3  # Corresponds to P(i-3)\n    p_prev_2 = 0  # Corresponds to P(i-2)\n    p_prev_1 = 2  # Corresponds to P(i-1)\n    total_sum = 5 # Sum of P(0), P(1), P(2)\n\n    # Calculate P(i) for i from 3 to n and add to sum\n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        p_current = p_prev_2 + p_prev_3\n        total_sum += p_current\n        # Update previous numbers for the next iteration\n        p_prev_3 = p_prev_2\n        p_prev_2 = p_prev_1\n        p_prev_1 = p_current\n\n    return total_sum"}
