{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even factors of a given number n.\n    Factors are iterated up to the square root of n for efficiency.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Iterate from 1 up to the square root of n\n    for i in range(1, int(n**0.5) + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            # i is a factor\n            if i % 2 == 0:\n                total_sum += i\n\n            # n // i is also a factor\n            # Check if i and n // i are different factors to avoid double counting\n            if i * i != n:\n                factor2 = n // i\n                if factor2 % 2 == 0:\n                    total_sum += factor2\n    return total_sum"}
