{"task_id": "Mbpp/478", "solution": "def remove_lowercase(input_string):\n    \"\"\"\n    Removes all contiguous lowercase substrings from the input_string.\n    Preserves all other characters and their original casing.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    i = 0\n    while i < len(input_string):\n        if 'a' <= input_string[i] <= 'z':\n            # Skip all contiguous lowercase characters\n            while i < len(input_string) and 'a' <= input_string[i] <= 'z':\n                i += 1\n        else:\n            result.append(input_string[i])\n            i += 1\n    return \"\".join(result)"}
