{"task_id": "Mbpp/566", "solution": "def sum_digits(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the digits of a non-negative integer.\n    The algorithm iterates through the digits, adding each to a running total.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    if number == 0:\n        return 0\n    while number > 0:\n        total_sum += number % 10\n        number //= 10\n    return total_sum"}
