{"task_id": "Mbpp/592", "solution": "def sum_Of_product(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Find the sum of the product of consecutive binomial coefficients.\"\"\"\n    total = 0\n    coeff = 1  # Represents C(n, k), starting with C(n, 0)\n\n    for k in range(n):\n        # Calculate C(n, k+1) from C(n, k)\n        # C(n, k+1) = C(n, k) * (n - k) / (k + 1)\n        next_coeff = coeff * (n - k) // (k + 1)\n        \n        # Add the product of C(n, k) and C(n, k+1) to the total\n        total += coeff * next_coeff\n        \n        # Update current_coeff for the next iteration (it becomes C(n, k+1))\n        coeff = next_coeff\n        \n    return total"}
