{"task_id": "Mbpp/610", "solution": "def remove_kth_element(lst: list, k: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Return a new list with the k-th element removed.\n\n    Parameters\n    ----------\n    lst : list\n        The input list from which to remove an element.\n    k : int\n        The 1\u2011based position of the element to remove.\n\n    Returns\n    -------\n    list\n        A new list containing all elements of `lst` except the element at\n        position `k`.\n\n    Raises\n    ------\n    IndexError\n        If `k` is less than 1 or greater than the length of `lst`.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not 1 <= k <= len(lst):\n        raise IndexError(f\"k={k} is out of bounds for list of length {len(lst)}\")\n    return lst[:k-1] + lst[k:]"}
