{"task_id": "Mbpp/616", "solution": "def tuple_modulo(tuple1: tuple, tuple2: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Compute element-wise modulo of two tuples.\n    Raises ValueError if tuples differ in length, ZeroDivisionError if any divisor is zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(tuple1) != len(tuple2):\n        raise ValueError(\"Input tuples must have the same length.\")\n\n    if any(b == 0 for b in tuple2):\n        raise ZeroDivisionError(\"Modulo by zero detected in second tuple.\")\n\n    return tuple(a % b for a, b in zip(tuple1, tuple2))"}
