{"task_id": "Mbpp/644", "solution": "def reverse_Array_Upto_K(array, k):\n    \"\"\"\n    Reverses the first k elements of an array, returning a new list.\n    If k is non-positive, returns a shallow copy; if k is greater than or equal to array length, the entire array is reversed.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(array)\n\n    if k <= 0:\n        return array[:]\n\n    if k >= n:\n        return array[::-1]\n\n    prefix = array[:k][::-1]\n    suffix = array[k:]\n    return prefix + suffix"}
