{"task_id": "Mbpp/786", "solution": "def right_insertion(sorted_list: list[int], value: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Finds the rightmost insertion point for a value in a sorted list using binary search.\"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(sorted_list)\n\n    while low < high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if sorted_list[mid] <= value:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid\n    return low"}
