{"task_id": "Mbpp/791", "solution": "def remove_nested(input_tuple: tuple) -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Removes nested tuples from the given tuple, returning a new tuple with only non-tuple elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    for item in input_tuple:\n        if not isinstance(item, tuple):\n            result.append(item)\n    return tuple(result)"}
