{"task_id": "Mbpp/793", "solution": "def last(arr, target):\n    \"\"\"Finds the last position of an element in a sorted array using binary search.\n    Returns the index of the last occurrence, or -1 if the target is not found.\"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(arr) - 1\n    result = -1\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == target:\n            result = mid\n            low = mid + 1  # Search for a later occurrence in the right subarray\n        elif arr[mid] < target:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:  # arr[mid] > target\n            high = mid - 1\n    return result"}
